    // 1. Best-Fit Penalty: Penalize large post-residuals to keep bins tightly packed.
    // The base score is post_residual, which naturally favors Best-Fit.

    // 2. Lookahead Integration: If the next item fits into the current post_residual, 
    // reward this placement heavily to encourage "perfect pairings".
    if next_item_size > 0 && post_residual >= next_item_size {
